Dear Natalie,

The featureCounts function in Rsubread package can summarize read counts for genes or exons (each read will be assigned to at most one exon if reads are summarized to exon level). It uses the NCBI annotation for read summarization, but you can provide your own annotation as well.

This function is very quick. It only takes a couple of minutes to summarize 10 million reads.

Hope you will find it useful.

Cheers,
Wei


