>    338254  331060  529608   67438     624
>
> Note that it doesn't contain *all* SNPs from dbSNP Build 132:
> only a subset of "clean" SNPs (see ?SNPlocs.Hsapiens.dbSNP.20101109
> for the details).
>
>   >  ch22snps<- getSNPlocs("ch22")
>   >  ch22snps[1:5, ]
