The reason this works is that the 2nd argument on the function
definition is 'pdat'... so calling:

lumi450k<-methylumIDAT(barcodes,getwd())

is equivalent to:

lumi450k<-methylumIDAT(barcodes, pdat=getwd())

which is not what you want...

b


