Simply define the breaks for the colours. Something like that :

mat = matrix(runif(100,0,1), ncol=10)
heatmap.2(mat, breaks=c(0,0.01,0.05,1), col=c("grey", "yellow", "blue"), 
dendrogram="none", trace="none")

